- **Linear search**: O(n)
- **Binary search**: O(log n), sorted data

```
Low ← 1
High ← N
Found ← FALSE
WHILE Low <= High AND NOT Found
    Mid ← (Low + High) DIV 2
    IF A[Mid] = Target THEN
        Found ← TRUE
    ELSE
        IF A[Mid] < Target THEN
            Low ← Mid + 1
        ELSE
            High ← Mid - 1
        ENDIF
    ENDIF
ENDWHILE
```

